WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:07.700
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Who the hell is that guy?

00:00:08.343 --> 00:00:11.010
CATE SHORTLAND
I was really excited about Taskmaster

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.691
being this formidable opponent.

00:00:13.716 --> 00:00:16.008
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
As soon as Natasha starts to experience

00:00:16.017 --> 00:00:18.199
the Taskmaster's fighting style...

00:00:20.366 --> 00:00:21.433
She's at a loss.

00:00:24.009 --> 00:00:25.968
DAVID HARBOUR
He has the ability to mimic

00:00:25.977 --> 00:00:31.227
other characters' moves, from
Captain America, Black Panther, Hawkeye.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.881
RACHEL WEISZ
When you watch him, I think you feel like

00:00:36.872 --> 00:00:38.580
like he's the ultimate secret weapon.

